WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.105 --> 00:00:04.900
Meet Tapfour Connect.
One stand, one app.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.462
Pick your stand:
three designs, two finishes.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.158
Paste your Google Maps link,
and see what guests get.

4
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.904
