Scan for your live menu.
Sold out? The next scan shows it.

7
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:33.824
Add table ordering,
and orders pop up at your counter.

8
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.684
See every tap, and your busiest hours.

9
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.611
Change a link once,
and every stand follows.

10
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.895
Five stands and the app:
₱3,000 once, ₱299 a month.

11
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.131
No time? We build it for you.

12
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.504
Tapfour Connect.
Build yours, just below.
